# Compiler output artifacts, not evidence. `cmd.txt` is the command as filed,
# which includes `/Fo test.mso`, so a clean control compile drops a DXIL blob
# here. `scratch/` holds the per-release `.mso` files written by
# release-matrix.py, which deliberately keeps them out of `test.mso` so a
# release run can never restamp the ground-truth artifact.
test.mso
scratch/
